# Run a node (stranger / any LLM)

When the human wants to **run / start / follow / full-node / guardian /
Signet / mainnet** a KRAY node:

1. Read `docs/RUN-NODE.md`.
2. Ask the `docs/RUN-NODE.md` quiz (Q1–Q6 + Q2b if follow: universe ·
   role · custody hand · proofs · earn · updates · optional mind).
   Do not start first. Signet `:4480` · mainnet `:4481` · lab `:4477`.
   Both public writers are live. Solo walkthrough:
   `docs/RUN-NODE-TUTORIAL.md`.
3. Run `node scripts/follow/preflight.mjs --universe … --role …` and obey it.
4. “Full node” = follow, not `server.mjs`.
5. This clone is never the public writer. No vault. No second pen.
6. Earn 3× = `/validate` → Hold the library. Never export a wallet key
   into `KRAY_MINER_SK` or the node.

Skill: `.cursor/skills/kraynet-run/SKILL.md`.
